        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emmanuelle Vaugier, Josh Hartnett, Michael Lehmann, Rob Perez, Shannyn Sossamon, Paulo Costanzo, Sebastian Spence, Greg Evigan\n- Products: Saw II, Saw IV, 40 Days and 40 Nights, Cerberus\n- Roles: Addison Corday\n- Organizations: Sci Fi Channel\n\nFacts:\n- 40 Days and 40 Nights is a 2002 satirical erotic romantic comedy film directed by Michael Lehmann, written by Rob Perez, and starring Josh Hartnett, Shannyn Sossamon, and Paulo Costanzo.\n- Emmanuelle Vaugier had a supporting role in the Josh Hartnett film 40 Days and 40 Nights.\n- Cerberus, also known as Cerberus: the Guardian of Hell, is a 2005 Sci Fi Channel original film starring Sebastian Spence, Emmanuelle Vaugier, and Greg Evigan.\n- Emmanuelle Vaugier appeared as Addison Corday in Saw II and Saw IV.",
